        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ab'ekika kya Efuraimu n'ekya Manasse boona Musengwa Katonda yaababeera, baalumba ekibuga Betheli, ekyayetebwangaku Luzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatuma abakeesi mu kibuga ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakeesi abo baabona omusaadha ali kukivaamu, baamukoba bati: “Tukweghemba otulagirire ghe tughanga okubita okwingira mu kibuga, twidha kukubisa bukalamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha yaabalagirira. Bale baita ab'omu kibuga boonaboona, okutoolaku omusaadha oyo n'ab'omu maka ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha oyo yaaja mu nsi ey'Abahitti, yaazimbayo ekibuga, yaakituuma eriina Luzi. Era bakaakyeta eriina eryo okutuusa ni mpegaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
