              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli ni bwe beeyongera okuba ab'amaani tibaabingamu Bakanaani boonaboona kubamalamu aye baabakakanga bwa kubakolera mirimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
